  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0c5cbb483bddf4c478998c8960188805, type: 3}
  m_Name: L5_ShadowGoodEndPhase_2.5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - (Breathing heavily, his silhouette flickering like a damaged film reel)
  - "He\u2019s loud, isn't he? The Overexposed... the screaming judgment of everyone
    who told you to 'just smile.'"
  - "You're fighting both of us now\u2014your own sadness and their expectations.
    It\u2019s exhausting, isn't it? To be caught between a past that won't let go
    and a future that wants to erase you."
  - "You\u2019re shaking, Minh. Your grip on that camera is slipping. Why keep fighting?
    Even if you win, she\u2019s still gone! Even if you step out of this park, the
    bench stays empty!"
  - "I\u2019m trying to save you from that emptiness!"
  - "But fine... if you want to see the end of this reel so badly, let\u2019s see
    if you can handle the glare when the film finally snaps!"
